body: |2-
  Goals, actions, the choices they wait on and the information they
  need, drawn as Jeff's dream routine draws them, in ordinary skg: an
  action's children say what it helps, what it depends on, and whether
  it is plan-complete. Begun in the first dream, 2026-11-15.
